  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You tear a hole in the fabric of reality and send a bolt of cosmic matter at a creature within range. Make a ranged spell attack against it; the target gains no benefit from Half Cover or Three-Quarters Cover. On a hit, it takes 6d6 Force damage.</p><p>Each time you roll a 6 on a d6 for this spell, you can roll another d6 and add it to the damage, up to a number of extra d6s equal to your spellcasting ability modifier for the casting.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> The damage increases by 1d6 for each spell slot level above 3.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-iM6tXG7A69oZ81Ty\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Roll the extra d6s for the 6s by hand.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
